<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>School Announcement</title>
  <style>
    body {
      background-color: #2b1b17;
      color: #e67e22;
      font-family: 'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 50px;
      margin: 0;
      height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .container {
      border: 5px solid #d35400;
      padding: 40px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      background-color: #1a0f0d;
      display: inline-block;
      min-width: 600px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      text-shadow: 3px 3px #000, 0 0 20px #e67e22;
      margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    }
    p {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
    }
    .signature {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: #f39c12;
      font-style: italic;
      font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', 'Arial', sans-serif;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }
    .emoji {
      font-size: 5rem;
    }
    .instruction {
      color: #888888;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-family: sans-serif;
      margin-top: 25px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="emoji">🦃 🍂 🍁</div>
    <h1>HAPPY THANKSGIVING WEEK!</h1>
    <p>Wishing you a wonderful week of learning and gratitude!</p>
    <p>Enjoy your upcoming break with family and friends! 🥧</p>
    <p class="signature">- Sent from You-Know-Who 🍂✨</p>
    <div class="instruction">(Please close this tab to return to work)</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
